ax\"><span class=\"meta\">coax/book · 57 chapters</span><h2 class=\"bk-card-t\">The Coax Programming Language</h2><p class=\"bk-card-d\">Programs in Coax, the language every other OpenAgents book uses.</p></a><a class=\"bk-card\" href=\"/books/openagents\"><span class=\"meta\">openagents/book · 0 chapters</span><h2 class=\"bk-card-t\">The OpenAgents Book</h2><p class=\"bk-card-d\">The OpenAgents apps, Bitcoin/Lightning wallet, and composable general agent.</p></a><a class=\"bk-card\" href=\"/books/bitcoin\"><span class=\"meta\">bitcoin/book · 0 chapters</span><h2 class=\"bk-card-t\">Bitcoin From Scratch</h2><p class=\"bk-card-d\">Bitcoin and Lightning in Coax, from SHA-256 and secp256k1 to channels.</p></a><a class=\"bk-card\" href=\"/books/nostr\"><span class=\"meta\">nostr/book · 0 chapters</span><h2 class=\"bk-card-t\">Nostr From Scratch</h2><p class=\"bk-card-d\">A Nostr client, a relay, and the NIPs OpenAgents uses, built from scratch.</p></a><a class=\"bk-card\" href=\"/books/coder\"><span class=\"meta\">coder/book · 0 chapters</span><h2 class=\"bk-card-t\">Coder: Coding Agents From Scratch</h2><p class=\"bk-card-d\">OpenAgents' coding agent, sandbox, harness, and lessons from other agents.</p></a><a class=\"bk-card\" href=\"/books/psionic\"><span class=\"meta\">psionic/book · 0 chapters</span><h2 class=\"bk-card-t\">Psionic: ML From Scratch</h2><p class=\"bk-card-d\">A machine-learning library in Coax that runs, serves, and trains models.</p></a><a class=\"bk-card\" href=\"/books/metaverse-engine\"><span class=\"meta\">metaverse-engine/book · 0 chapters</span><h2 class=\"bk-card-t\">Building the OpenAgents Metaverse Engine</h2><p class=\"bk-card-d\">A real-time engine: frame loop, world, renderer, physics, realms, and multiplayer.</p></a><a class=\"bk-card\" href=\"/books/everglade\"><span class=\"meta\">everglade/book · 0 chapters</span><h2 class=\"bk-card-t\">Building Everglade</h2><p class=\"bk-card-d\">An MMORPG on the D&amp;D 5E SRD, built on the OpenAge